  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the region bounded by the curves <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>. The curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;divides <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> into two regions of areas <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "19",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/75c3f1db-0459-4f62-b907-c89f11812fc1-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 214px;\" /></p><p>Intersection point of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;in the first quadrant will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, intersection point of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;in first quadrant will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Area of the region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mstyle mathvariant=\"italic\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mstyle><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Area of region&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>48</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>48</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
